  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Webinar on Let’s Talk Science</h2>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n<strong>Organizing Department Name:   Computer Science &amp; engineering</strong>\n\n<strong>International Webinar: Jointly Organized   By: Department of AI &amp; ML, BMSIT Bangalore &amp; Department of CSE ATMECE, Mysore</strong>\n\n<strong>Title of the event: Webinar on Let’s Talk Science</strong>\n\n<strong>Date: 17-12-2020, 10 AM TO 11 AM</strong>\n\n<strong>Event Convener: Dr. J V Gorabal, Professor CSE</strong>\n\n<strong>Event Coordinator: Mrs. Kavyashree E D Asst Prof CSE</strong>\n\n<strong>Venue \\Platform: Online: Google Meet</strong>\n\n<strong>Event Description:</strong>\n\n<strong>Agenda:</strong>\n\n<strong>Why Cancer is Difficult to treat</strong>\n<ul>\n \t<li><strong>Why was Corona easy to Vaccine</strong></li>\n \t<li><strong>Goals and Career from my perspective</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Resource Person: Dr. Rajshekhar Giraddi , Senior Scientist, Cancer Systems Therapeutics, Pfizer</strong>\n\n<strong>Total no audience Present: 200 from across the globe</strong>\n\n<strong>Welcome Address  : By Dr Bharathi MA HOD AIML BMSIT Bangalore, Vote of Thanks : Dr J V Gorabal Prof CSE, ATMECE, Mysore</strong>\n\n</div>\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-4489 aligncenter\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Brochure-732x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"1024\" />\n\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-4488 aligncenter\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Dr_Raj-300x247-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"247\" />\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Resource Person,</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Dr. Rajshekhar Giraddi</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Senior Scientist, Cancer Systems Therapeutics, Pfizer</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
